                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<p>а)  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\{\\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\pi k,\\frac{\\pi}{4}+2\\pi k\\mid k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\\}\"></span> ;  б)  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\,\\frac{3\\pi}{2},\\,\\frac{9\\pi}{4},\\,\\frac{5\\pi}{2}\"></span> . </p>",
                "title": "Ответ",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"
            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T18:28:29.175009+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<ol data-layout=\"source-subparts\" type=\"a\"><li data-list-marker=\"а)\">Вос­поль­зу­ем­ся тем, что <center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\sqrt{f}=g\\iff \\begin{cases}g\\ge 0\\\\f=g^{2}\\end{cases}\"></span> .</p></center><p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"6c878e49-a89e-4252-8fa9-ee1bead5b906\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\"/> </p><p>и про­из­ве­дем эк­ви­ва­лен­тые пре­об­ра­зо­ва­ния урав­не­ния:</p><center><p><span><span data-inline-latex=\"\\sqrt{\\sin x\\cdot\\cos x}=\\cos x\\Leftrightarrow\\begin{cases}\\sin x\\cdot\\cos x=\\cos^2 x,\\\\\\cos x\\geq 0\\end{cases}\\Leftrightarrow\\begin{cases}\\cos x(\\sin x-\\cos x)=0,\\\\\\cos x\\geq 0\\end{cases}\\Leftrightarrow\\begin{cases}\\left[\\begin{aligned}\\cos x&amp;=0,\\\\\\sin x&amp;=\\cos x\\end{aligned}\\right.\\\\\\cos x\\geq 0\\end{cases}\\Leftrightarrow\\left[\\begin{aligned}x&amp;=\\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\pi k,\\\\x&amp;=\\frac{\\pi}{4}+2\\pi k,\\end{aligned}\\right.\\quad k\\in\\mathbb{Z}.\"></span></span> </p><p> </p></center></li><li data-list-marker=\"б)\">От­бе­рем корни при по­мо­щи еди­нич­ной окруж­но­сти. Под­хо­дят  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\,\\frac{3\\pi}{2},\\,\\frac{9\\pi}{4},\\,\\frac{5\\pi}{2}\"></span> . </li></ol>",
