            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T17:57:27.552439+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<ol data-layout=\"source-subparts\" type=\"a\"><li data-list-marker=\"а)\">Ре­ши­те урав­не­ние  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\sqrt{-\\cos 2x}=\\cos x+\\sin x\"></span>.</li><li data-list-marker=\"б)\">Най­ди­те все корни урав­не­ния, при­над­ле­жа­щие от­рез­ку  <span data-inline-latex=\"[\\frac{3\\pi}{2};3\\pi]\"></span> . </li></ol>",
                "title": "Условие",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"
            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T17:57:27.552439+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<p><nobr>а)  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\{-\\frac{\\pi}{4}+\\pi k;\\frac{\\pi}{2}+2\\pi k\\mid k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\\}\"></span> ; </nobr> <nobr>б)  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{7\\pi}{4}\"></span> ,   <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{5\\pi}{2}\"></span> ,   <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{11\\pi}{4}\"></span> . </nobr></p>",
                "title": "Ответ",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"
            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T17:57:27.552439+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<ol data-layout=\"source-subparts\" type=\"a\"><li data-list-marker=\"а)\">Из­ба­вим­ся от ир­ра­ци­о­наль­но­сти:<center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\sqrt{-\\cos 2x}=\\cos x+\\sin x\\iff \\begin{cases}\\cos x+\\sin x\\ge 0\\\\-\\cos 2x=(\\cos x+\\sin x)^{2}\\end{cases}\"></span> .</p></center><p>Решим урав­не­ние си­сте­мы:</p><center><p><span><span data-inline-latex=\"1-2\\cos^{2} x=1+2\\sin x\\cos x\\iff 2\\cos^{2} x+2\\sin x\\cos x=0\\iff \\cos x(\\sin x+\\cos x)=0\\iff\"></span> <br/> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}\\cos x=0\\\\\\sin x+\\cos x=0\\end{aligned}\\right..\\quad \\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}\\cos x=0\\\\\\ctg x=-1\\end{aligned}\\right..\\quad \\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\pi k\\\\x=-\\frac{\\pi}{4}+\\pi k\\end{aligned}\\right..k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\"></span> </span></p></center><p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"24ff0f54-3123-4d1c-b4f7-539783346e1c\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\"/></p><p>Про­ве­рим вы­пол­не­ние не­ра­вен­ства  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\cos x+\\sin x\\ge 0\"></span> для най­ден­ных серий ре­ше­ний:</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"\\cos\\left(-\\frac{\\pi}{4}+\\pi k\\right)+\\sin\\left(-\\frac{\\pi}{4}+\\pi k\\right)=0\\text{ при всех целых }k,\\quad \\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\pi k\\right)+\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\pi k\\right)=\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\pi k\\right)=\\begin{cases}1,&amp;\\text{если число }k\\text{ чётное},\\\\-1,&amp;\\text{если число }k\\text{ нечётное}.\\end{cases}\"></span></p><p><span></span></p></center><p> Таким об­ра­зом, под­хо­дят две серии кор­ней:  <span data-inline-latex=\"x=-\\frac{\\pi}{4}+\\pi k\"></span>  и  <span data-inline-latex=\"x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}+2\\pi k\"></span>,  где  <span data-inline-latex=\"k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\"></span> .</p></li><li data-list-marker=\"б)\">Корни, при­над­ле­жа­щие от­рез­ку  <span data-inline-latex=\"[\\frac{3\\pi}{2};3\\pi]\"></span> ,  от­бе­рем при по­мо­щи три­го­но­мет­ри­че­ской окруж­но­сти (см. рис.). Под­хо­дят:  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{7\\pi}{4}\"></span> ,   <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{5\\pi}{2}\"></span> ,   <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{11\\pi}{4}\"></span> . </li></ol>",
                "title": "Решение",
                "asset_keys": [
                  "image_1"
                ]
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"
            },
